5 次 `runtime process exiting` 事件，路径均为 `/work`（#4），证明这是应用层面的逻辑错误，而非基础设施层面的问题（如 OOM）。\n3. **Trace 关联**：存在 `runtime_exit` 模式的 Trace（#5），进一步确认了进程退出发生在处理业务请求的过程中。\n\n由于采集了 `previous` 日志失败，缺少崩溃前具体的堆栈信息，但现有事实已足够将根因指向 `/opt/aiops/server.py` 中的运行时逻辑异常。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.4m\n├─ 问题定位: 17.0s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 57.2s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-06/workload-7679bcf76-jwr8b: 57.2s (Evidence 50.1s, RCA 6.9s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 12.4s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-06/workload-7679bcf76-jwr8b**: pod-crashloop-runtime\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 86.655, "metrics": {"run_id": "f5e85098d12844ba", "mttr": {"value": "1.4m", "seconds": 86.6616530418396, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "48%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-crashloop-runtime", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "完整因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-crashloop-runtime"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_